{"relationshipsSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/Trackers\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/Trackers\/s16SendableMetatypeP"],"type":"conformsTo","kind":"relationships","title":"Conforms To"}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/trackers\/tracker"]}],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"patch":0,"minor":3},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers"]]},"metadata":{"role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Tracker","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"Tracker","modules":[{"name":"Trackers"}],"externalID":"s:8Trackers7TrackerV","roleHeading":"Structure","symbolKind":"struct","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"Tracker"}],"remoteSource":{"url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/Traffluent\/blob\/main\/Sources\/Trackers\/Tracker.swift#L51","fileName":"Tracker.swift"}},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"kind":"symbol","sections":[],"topicSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/Records-swift.struct"],"title":"Structures","generated":true,"anchor":"Structures"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/init(consent:enrichers:samplers:samplingSeed:now:)","doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/init(store:consent:enrichers:samplers:samplingSeed:now:)"],"title":"Initializers","generated":true,"anchor":"Initializers"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/records-swift.property","doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/rejectionReports","doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/samplingDropReports"],"title":"Instance Properties","generated":true,"anchor":"Instance-Properties"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/enriched(by:)","doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/finish()","doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/flush()","doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/track(_:file:fileID:function:line:column:)"],"title":"Instance Methods","generated":true,"anchor":"Instance-Methods"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/current","doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/noOp"],"title":"Type Properties","generated":true,"anchor":"Type-Properties"}],"abstract":[{"text":"What app code tracks events with: it records each event, with the time, the caller’s source","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"location and the task’s context, as one of its ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/records-swift.property","type":"reference"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["Linux"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"Tracker"}]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","text":"Overview","anchor":"overview","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"A tracker is a value. Build one where the app starts, start delivering its records, and either","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"pass the tracker down or bind it to a task with ","type":"text"},{"code":"withTracker","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" and read it anywhere inside with","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/current","type":"reference"},{"text":":","type":"text"}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["let tracker = Tracker()","let delivery = tracker.records.batch().deliver(to: ConsoleDestination())","withTracker(tracker) {","    Tracker.current.track(SignedUp(plan: \"pro\"))","}","await tracker.finish()","try await delivery.execute()"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Copies share one stream of records. A binding reaches the work run inside "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"withTracker"},{"type":"text","text":", and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the child tasks it starts, but not callbacks a framework runs on tasks of its own, such as a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"UI framework’s button actions: pass those a tracker."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/track(_:file:fileID:function:line:column:)"},{"text":" does nothing but accept the event, from any","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"thread: it reads the clock, captures the call site and the task’s ","type":"text"},{"code":"ServiceContext","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", and queues","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"them. A worker the tracker owns, which never runs on the main actor, does everything else, in","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the order events were tracked: the constraints’ check, the enrichers, the samplers, the consent,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"a store’s writes, and publishing to ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/records-swift.property"},{"text":". No API runs that work on a caller’s thread. ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/flush()"},{"text":" waits for the worker to","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"catch up; ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/finish()"},{"text":" does too, then ends the records.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Tracked events wait in memory, without a bound, until the worker reaches them. The queue"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"can’t be bounded without losing something it mustn’t: it also carries consent decisions and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the waits of "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/flush()","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":", and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"track"},{"type":"text","text":" can’t wait for room without blocking its caller."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Without a store, records live in memory only, and records not yet delivered are lost if the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"process exits. A tracker given a ","type":"text"},{"code":"RecordStore","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" (","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/init(store:consent:enrichers:samplers:samplingSeed:now:)"},{"text":")","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"delivers what the store kept from earlier runs first, and writes each record to it once the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"worker reaches it: a record is durable from then on, and one tracked moments before the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"process is killed, not yet reached, is lost.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A tracker given "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Sampler","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"s keeps a seeded fraction of the events they apply to, dropping the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"rest before they are held, written or delivered and reporting them on"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/samplingDropReports","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"A tracker given a ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Consent","type":"reference"},{"text":" delivers an event only once its category is granted, holding it","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"while undecided and dropping it when denied; one given none delivers every event.","type":"text"}]}]}],"references":{"doc://Trackers/documentation/Trackers/Tracker/noOp":{"url":"\/documentation\/trackers\/tracker\/noop","identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/noOp","title":"noOp","role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"A tracker that drops every event, logging each one at debug level. Its ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/records-swift.property","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" are","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"empty.","type":"text"}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"static"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"let"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"noOp"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:8Trackers7TrackerV","text":"Tracker"}],"type":"topic"},"doc://Trackers/documentation/Trackers":{"title":"Trackers","abstract":[],"kind":"symbol","role":"collection","url":"\/documentation\/trackers","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers"},"doc://Trackers/documentation/Trackers/Sampler":{"url":"\/documentation\/trackers\/sampler","identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Sampler","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"Sampler"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Keeps a fraction of the events it applies to, and drops the rest before they are held, written"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"or delivered: event by event, or a whole group of events, such as a session, at once."}],"title":"Sampler","type":"topic","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"id